Shopping assistant is one of the most persuasive sales in traditional commerce. Shopping assistant offer help in a store, provide additional information on products and simplify decision making process helping to find a good that satisfies customer’s requirements and various constraints. (Bogdanovych et al., 2005)
Happy Assistant is “a natural language dialog-based navigation system that helps users access e-commerce sites to find relevant information about products and services” (Chai et al., 2000). The system is composed of three main modules: the presenta
